@startuml architecture
title Secure File Vault - System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

' Zones
rectangle "Public Zone" #DDDDFF {
  actor User as user

  component "Frontend Container\nNGINX Alpine\n(HTTPS 443, HTTP 80)" as frontend
}

rectangle "Private Zone\nDocker Bridge Network (172.20.0.0/16)" #DDFFDD {
  component "Backend Container\nNode.js 20 Alpine\n(HTTPS 3000)" as backend
  database "Database Container\nMySQL 8.0\n(TLS 3306)" as db
}

' Relationships
user --> frontend : HTTPS (TLS 1.2/1.3)\nPort 443\nWeb UI + API Proxy
frontend --> backend : HTTPS (TLS 1.2/1.3)\nPort 3000\nREST API /api/*
backend --> db : TLS encrypted MySQL\nPort 3306\nClient certificate auth

' Notes on components
note right of frontend
**Deployment**: Docker container (nginx:alpine)
**Ports**: 443 (HTTPS), 80 (HTTP redirect)
**TLS**: X.509 certificate (RSA-2048)
**Functions**:
- Serves static HTML/JS files
- Reverse proxy to Backend API
**Integrity**: SHA-256 checksums verified at startup
end note

note right of backend
**Deployment**: Docker container (node:20-alpine)
**Port**: 3000 (HTTPS only)
**TLS**: X.509 certificate (RSA-2048)
**REST Endpoints**:
- /api/register, /api/login
- /api/refresh, /api/logout
- /api/upload, /api/files
- /api/files/:id (GET/DELETE)
**Authentication**: JWT (HS512)
**Integrity**: SHA-256 checksums verified at startup
end note

note right of db
**Deployment**: Docker container (mysql:8.0)
**Port**: 3306 (TLS required)
**TLS**: X.509 CA + server + client certs
**Auth**: Client certificate + password
**Tables**:
- users: id, email, password_hash, created_at
- files: id, user_id, filepath, iv, auth_tag,
  encrypted_dek, dek_iv, dek_auth_tag,
  file_hash, created_at
- refresh_tokens: id, user_id, token,
  expires_at, created_at
**Integrity**: SHA-256 of init.sql verified at startup
end note

@enduml
